<%args>
    $bulk_js_menu
    $prefill_ids => ''
</%args>
<% $bulk_js_menu %>
<form name="bulk_gene" action="/bulk/gene/submit/" method="post" enctype="multipart/form-data">
<table summary="" cellpadding="10" width="100%"><tr><td valign="top" bgcolor="#EEEEEE" width="320">
輸入基因識別碼列表，或上傳以空格/換行/製表符分隔的識別碼檔案(Enter a list of gene identifiers or upload a file containing identifiers separated by whitespace)：<br />
<table summary="" width="100%" cellpadding="0"><tr><td>
<textarea name="ids" rows="10" cols="30">
<% $prefill_ids |h %>
</textarea>
</td>
<td>
<i>範例(Example)：</i>
<pre style="border: 1px solid gray; padding: 5px">
Solyc01g005080.2
AT1G56650.1
PGSC0003DMG400012540
Os02g0289500
</pre>
</td></tr></table>
<br />
<br />

及/或上傳識別碼列表檔案(And/or upload list file)：<br /><input type="file" name="gene_file" />
<br />
<br />

</td>
<td valign="top" bgcolor="#EEEEEE" width="320">

<b>下載基因資訊(Download gene information)</b>：<br />
<div style="padding-left: 1em">
    <input type="radio" name="gene_type" value="cdna" checked="checked" />cDNA 序列(cDNA sequence) <br />
    <input type="radio" name="gene_type" value="cds" checked="unchecked" />CDS 序列(CDS sequence) <br />
    <input type="radio" name="gene_type" value="protein" checked="unchecked" />蛋白質序列(Protein sequence) <br />
</div>
</td></tr></table>

<input type="submit" value="送出(Submit)" /><br />
</form>
